  "-1464989195": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "children": [
    -1530302244,
    -1186919810,
    -87236860
   ],
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Hi everyone, wow, this still feels unreal. When I started, I just wanted to find myself again, to feel confident and alive. I didn’t think anyone would care about my story.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   },
   "conditions": [
    {
     "kind": "compareNumber",
     "type": "ConditionMathCompareIntegers",
     "title": "If Events_Only_Done_2[convention-personality] = 0",
     "fields": {
      "m_Value": {
       "kind": "variable",
       "variable": {
        "scope": "global",
        "name": "convention-personality",
        "list": "Events_Only_Done_2",
        "type": "number"
       }
      },
      "m_CompareTo": {
       "m_Comparison": "Equals",
       "m_CompareTo": {
        "kind": "value",
        "value": 0
       }
      }
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  "-1043240647": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "children": [
    -279898802,
    837773199,
    -1458325930
   ],
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I never imagined standing here in front of all these faces and cameras. When I joined Starmaker, I was terrified.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   },
   "conditions": [
    {
     "kind": "compareNumber",
     "type": "ConditionMathCompareIntegers",
     "title": "If Events_Only_Done_2[convention-personality] = 1",
     "fields": {
      "m_Value": {
       "kind": "variable",
       "variable": {
        "scope": "global",
        "name": "convention-personality",
        "list": "Events_Only_Done_2",
        "type": "number"
       }
      },
      "m_CompareTo": {
       "m_Comparison": "Equals",
       "m_CompareTo": {
        "kind": "value",
        "value": 1
       }
      }
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  "-24225707": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "children": [
    -1003314020,
    149398012,
    -75553955
   ],
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Before I started my Starmaker Page, everyone had an opinion. Don’t wear this. Don’t say that. Don’t act like that. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   },
   "conditions": [
    {
     "kind": "compareNumber",
     "type": "ConditionMathCompareIntegers",
     "title": "If Events_Only_Done_2[convention-personality] = 2",
     "fields": {
      "m_Value": {
       "kind": "variable",
       "variable": {
        "scope": "global",
        "name": "convention-personality",
        "list": "Events_Only_Done_2",
        "type": "number"
       }
      },
      "m_CompareTo": {
       "m_Comparison": "Equals",
       "m_CompareTo": {
        "kind": "value",
        "value": 2
       }
      }
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  "1702355159": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "children": [
    -1686290900,
    429578267,
    236124517
   ],
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Let’s stop pretending. You all know me. You’ve seen my videos, my pictures, the way I move when I’m wet and desperate and loving every second of it. That’s me. I moan, I beg, I tease...",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   },
   "conditions": [
    {
     "kind": "compareNumber",
     "type": "ConditionMathCompareIntegers",
     "title": "If Events_Only_Done_2[convention-personality] = 3",
     "fields": {
      "m_Value": {
       "kind": "variable",
       "variable": {
        "scope": "global",
        "name": "convention-personality",
        "list": "Events_Only_Done_2",
        "type": "number"
       }
      },
      "m_CompareTo": {
       "m_Comparison": "Equals",
       "m_CompareTo": {
        "kind": "value",
        "value": 3
       }
      }
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  "-1530302244": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1464989195,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "But I learned that people connect to honesty more than perfection. It’s not about being flawless, it’s about being real.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1186919810": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1464989195,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "If there’s one thing I want to say, it’s this: you’re allowed to start over, you’re allowed to shine again.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-87236860": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1464989195,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Believe me, the world always needs more kindness and a little courage.\"",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-279898802": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1043240647,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "But then I learned something: confidence isn’t something you find, it’s something you fake until it sticks.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1003314020": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -24225707,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I was shrinking into someone else’s idea of who I should be. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1686290900": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1702355159,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Every orgasm, every glare, every filthy thought you’ve had watching me, I own it. People call me a slut like it’s supposed to hurt, but it doesn’t.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "429578267": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1702355159,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I turned lust into a career, pleasure into art, and my body into a brand. I fuck like I mean it, I perform like I breathe, and I’m not ashamed of a single second.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "236124517": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1702355159,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "So yeah, I’m a slut, I love cocks, and I worked damn hard to be this good at it.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "149398012": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -24225707,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "So I stopped. I started speaking my mind, taking what I wanted, and walking through every door that used to scare me.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-75553955": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -24225707,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "If that makes some people uncomfortable, good. I didn’t get here by asking permission. I got here by deciding who I am and refusing to apologize for it.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "837773199": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1043240647,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "A little smile, a teasing glance, a bit of playful charm, and suddenly you stop caring what anyone thinks. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1458325930": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1043240647,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "And I love every second of it.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
